<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA RESULTS AND STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA RESULTS AND STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LA MADDALENA, Sardinia 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading timings</p>
<p>in the fifth and final 150 km stage of the Tour of Sardinia</p>
<p>cycle race on Sunday (Italian unless stated):</p>
<p>1. Massimiliano Mori	    3 hours 47 minutes three seconds</p>
<p>2. Claudio Chiappucci</p>
<p>3. Luca Mazzanti</p>
<p>4. Sandro Giacomelli</p>
<p>5. Alessandro Bertolini</p>
<p>6. Germano Pierdomenico</p>
<p>7. Stefano Finesso</p>
<p>8. Andrea Tafi</p>
<p>9. Roberto Caruso</p>
<p> 10. Nikolay Bo Larsen (Denmark)	   all same time as Mori</p>
<p>Leading final standings:</p>
<p>  1. Roberto Petito	    22 hours three minutes 30 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Chiappucci			   8 seconds behind</p>
<p>  3. Bertolini			   14 seconds</p>
<p>  4. Gabriele Missaglia		16</p>
<p>  5. Mori				  20</p>
<p>  6. Vyacheslav Djavanian (Russia) 22</p>
<p>  7. Armin Meier (Switzerland)     23</p>
<p>  8. Mazzanti			    26</p>
<p>  9. Pierdomenico			same time</p>
<p> 10. Bo Larsen			   30</p>
</text>
